# Another World (WotG 28), Prog 0. From Northern San d'Oria, the zone line into Southern San d'Oria plays no zone-in
# event (the previous zone is not East Ronfaure). In Chateau d'Oraguille Halver at Prog 0 plays nothing of the
# mission's: his own script shows its text 7909 (HALVER_OFFSET + 1092, its line for a char of Bastok, the char's
# nation).
lists SouthernSanDoria/onZoneIn/1 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/945 ChateauDoraguille/Halver/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/566
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=128.3,-6.5,97.2 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg AnotherWorld current
login
zoneline SouthernSanDoria                  # from Northern San d'Oria: no 945
warp 2,0.1,2 ChateauDoraguille
trigger Halver                             # Prog 0
finish-if-event
